(4020596, 575470, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Great idea and nice exposure - Can''t help but think just concentrating on the plug may have had more impact as the hole above is a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice image - Great idea and nice exposure - Can''t help but think just concentrating on the plug may have had more impact as the hole above is a little distracting.', '2007-08-22 11:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
