(4020789, 575197, 26001, '<td valign="top">the first thing that came to my mind was an hourglass.<br/>one of the most appealing shots in this back-lit glass category. the way curves are intertwined is just priceless. i personally would have cropped the base of glasses from the top to make this excellent shot a bit "cleaner" though. they add unnecessary complicated element to the shot and takes away viewer''s attention from beautiful curves. one of my favorites of this challenge. good luck.</td>', 'the first thing that came to my mind was an hourglass.one of the most appealing shots in this back-lit glass category. the way curves are intertwined is just priceless. i personally would have cropped the base of glasses from the top to make this excellent shot a bit "cleaner" though. they add unnecessary complicated element to the shot and takes away viewer''s attention from beautiful curves. one of my favorites of this challenge. good luck.', '2007-08-22 12:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
