(4026043, 575228, 33535, '<td valign="top">cool, another insect''s x-ray, well done.<br/>i like the black line quite alot, but would have been better if the bottom left part was black, too. or a least so brownish-dirty looking, is think that''s a bit distracting.<br/>nice composition and contrasts, a 7</td>', 'cool, another insect''s x-ray, well done.i like the black line quite alot, but would have been better if the bottom left part was black, too. or a least so brownish-dirty looking, is think that''s a bit distracting.nice composition and contrasts, a 7', '2007-08-24 12:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026049, 575241, 33535, '<td valign="top">cool, that''s something different, like it quite alot.<br/>i think you could''t worked on the crop a bit, like maybe cropping off the upper and left part a bitand give some more space on the bottom, would make a better framing in my opinion.<br/>8</td>', 'cool, that''s something different, like it quite alot.i think you could''t worked on the crop a bit, like maybe cropping off the upper and left part a bitand give some more space on the bottom, would make a better framing in my opinion.8', '2007-08-24 12:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026056, 573552, 33535, '<td valign="top">hehe, a "study of emptiness"<br/>really well done, this shot kinda reflects my mood of the last weeks, i''ve been so uninspired und desperate...<br/>the b&amp;w really works well, there''s some noise on the skin, but that''s ok, the tones are really good overall.<br/>9</td>', 'hehe, a "study of emptiness"really well done, this shot kinda reflects my mood of the last weeks, i''ve been so uninspired und desperate...the b&w really works well, there''s some noise on the skin, but that''s ok, the tones are really good overall.9', '2007-08-24 12:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026061, 574442, 33535, '<td valign="top">work on the crop, cut the background off and rotate the whole thing so that the big vein is straight up.<br/>i like the color, a 5</td>', 'work on the crop, cut the background off and rotate the whole thing so that the big vein is straight up.i like the color, a 5', '2007-08-24 12:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4026064, 572908, 33535, '<td valign="top">cool, i like the abstraction of it.<br/>the dof with the rain drops on the left becoming OOF is really nice too<br/>a 7</td>', 'cool, i like the abstraction of it.the dof with the rain drops on the left becoming OOF is really nice tooa 7', '2007-08-24 13:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
