(4031065, 574695, 17296, '<td valign="top">While it clearly isn''t backlit, I do find it visually interesting. I would suggest moving the leaf behind the fork if not out of the shot altogether. I think if you were to position the fork differently the difference in texture between the surface and the utensil could be very interesting. Perhaps a little post-processing could add interest as well.</td>', 'While it clearly isn''t backlit, I do find it visually interesting. I would suggest moving the leaf behind the fork if not out of the shot altogether. I think if you were to position the fork differently the difference in texture between the surface and the utensil could be very interesting. Perhaps a little post-processing could add interest as well.', '2007-08-26 23:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
