(4032968, 575543, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the timing of this shot because I find that one rear foot and splash of water intriguing, though I know it''s not meant to be the focal point here.  I guess I''m more used to all the paddling being below the surface; I like seeing more of the propellor action.<br/> <br/>The whites look a little blown out on my monitor.</td>', 'I like the timing of this shot because I find that one rear foot and splash of water intriguing, though I know it''s not meant to be the focal point here.  I guess I''m more used to all the paddling being below the surface; I like seeing more of the propellor action. The whites look a little blown out on my monitor.', '2007-08-27 16:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
