(4032996, 575231, 65234, '<td valign="top">Honestly, this doesn''t appeal to me.  The focus seems to be on the wick and the lighting there looks more interesting than on the rest of the candle, but it''s too small a part of the overall image to really see any detail.  The candle itself is neither reflective nor of varying density so the light doesn''t play off of it or shine through it in interesting ways to me.</td>', 'Honestly, this doesn''t appeal to me.  The focus seems to be on the wick and the lighting there looks more interesting than on the rest of the candle, but it''s too small a part of the overall image to really see any detail.  The candle itself is neither reflective nor of varying density so the light doesn''t play off of it or shine through it in interesting ways to me.', '2007-08-27 16:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033033, 573116, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect; I like the motion but it does not appear to me that you avoided silhouetting your subject.  I would probably crop at least a third more off the top to get rid of most of the glaring white and make the horse and rider a bigger part of the image.</td>', 'Interesting effect; I like the motion but it does not appear to me that you avoided silhouetting your subject.  I would probably crop at least a third more off the top to get rid of most of the glaring white and make the horse and rider a bigger part of the image.', '2007-08-27 16:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
