(4033048, 574665, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the gull.  Centered composition isn''t doing much for me and I wish the backlighting were stronger to give this more interest.</td>', 'Nice detail on the gull.  Centered composition isn''t doing much for me and I wish the backlighting were stronger to give this more interest.', '2007-08-27 17:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
