(4033056, 575192, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and perspective; looking at it feels like being on the dance floor at a party!</td>', 'I like the colors and perspective; looking at it feels like being on the dance floor at a party!', '2007-08-27 17:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033060, 574695, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice mix of colors, light and textures.</td>', 'Nice mix of colors, light and textures.', '2007-08-27 17:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033067, 575228, 65234, '<td valign="top">Or innards, as the case may be (sorry - I can''t help the correction; I used to edit text at one point in my life).  Interesting composition and certainly an unusual view of a mantis!</td>', 'Or innards, as the case may be (sorry - I can''t help the correction; I used to edit text at one point in my life).  Interesting composition and certainly an unusual view of a mantis!', '2007-08-27 17:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033071, 575208, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the POV!  Somehow I expect to see a rainbow in that upper left bit of sky.</td>', 'Love the POV!  Somehow I expect to see a rainbow in that upper left bit of sky.', '2007-08-27 17:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033073, 573516, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the expression.  Highlights look very blown on my monitor.</td>', 'I like the expression.  Highlights look very blown on my monitor.', '2007-08-27 17:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033094, 575071, 65234, '<td valign="top">Well-composed (the photo; I''d have to ask my daughter to proof the equation).  The contrasting colors are harsh to my eye but I suppose that better emphasizes the process.</td>', 'Well-composed (the photo; I''d have to ask my daughter to proof the equation).  The contrasting colors are harsh to my eye but I suppose that better emphasizes the process.', '2007-08-27 17:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033099, 575401, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nicely golden.</td>', 'Very nicely golden.', '2007-08-27 17:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033102, 575197, 65234, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and lighting!</td>', 'Excellent composition and lighting!', '2007-08-27 17:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033105, 575374, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice POV for a contemplative little angel.</td>', 'Nice POV for a contemplative little angel.', '2007-08-27 17:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033115, 575471, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the grasshopper!  Not sure how I feel about the composition; the dark shape on the left echoes the curve of the plant''s branch/stem, but draws an awful lot of attention away from the grasshopper and plant (which interest me more).</td>', 'Great detail on the grasshopper!  Not sure how I feel about the composition; the dark shape on the left echoes the curve of the plant''s branch/stem, but draws an awful lot of attention away from the grasshopper and plant (which interest me more).', '2007-08-27 17:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033118, 573401, 65234, '<td valign="top">I love to see ordinary objects lit and photographed so I appreciate them in a new way.  This is really, really well done.</td>', 'I love to see ordinary objects lit and photographed so I appreciate them in a new way.  This is really, really well done.', '2007-08-27 17:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033121, 574375, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice soothing color and even a bit of detail on the highlit bee.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice soothing color and even a bit of detail on the highlit bee.  Well done.', '2007-08-27 17:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033129, 575290, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  I love the colors and the way the light outlines the grasshopper and his perch.</td>', 'Very cool!  I love the colors and the way the light outlines the grasshopper and his perch.', '2007-08-27 17:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033140, 575541, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like columbine; nice detail and I like the tones.  Something about the composition feels a little unbalanced to me ... I think I''d take a little more off the left side, still keeping some of that pod that''s pointing so nicely to the corner.</td>', 'Looks like columbine; nice detail and I like the tones.  Something about the composition feels a little unbalanced to me ... I think I''d take a little more off the left side, still keeping some of that pod that''s pointing so nicely to the corner.', '2007-08-27 17:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033202, 575234, 82692, '<td valign="top">this is an amazing photo</td>', 'this is an amazing photo', '2007-08-27 17:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033210, 575258, 82692, '<td valign="top">this picture is really cool how you can like see details in your hand</td>', 'this picture is really cool how you can like see details in your hand', '2007-08-27 18:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033259, 574488, 65234, '<td valign="top">Fascinating!  Not quite sure what I''m looking at but it''s a colorful and pleasing composition with some movement to it.</td>', 'Fascinating!  Not quite sure what I''m looking at but it''s a colorful and pleasing composition with some movement to it.', '2007-08-27 18:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4033266, 573433, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice; the curve of the stem and the parallel between the petals and leaf makes for an interesting composition.  Backlighting is nice and understated.</td>', 'Nice; the curve of the stem and the parallel between the petals and leaf makes for an interesting composition.  Backlighting is nice and understated.', '2007-08-27 18:17:59.000000', NULL, 1);
