(4034365, 575400, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice texture.  It does seem to come off as an unsharp image that was sharpened, though that effect might have been caused by diffraction from so much backlight...</td>', 'Nice texture.  It does seem to come off as an unsharp image that was sharpened, though that effect might have been caused by diffraction from so much backlight...', '2007-08-27 23:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034388, 575140, 67841, '<td valign="top">Though the composition leaves me wanting, the display of backlighting is quite nice.  It is a neat effect, but the image comes off a little busy with all the cacti in there.  Moving in closer or simplifying the composition by framing a singular cactus with a simpler backdrop would have been more appealing to me.  &lt;&lt; 6 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Though the composition leaves me wanting, the display of backlighting is quite nice.  It is a neat effect, but the image comes off a little busy with all the cacti in there.  Moving in closer or simplifying the composition by framing a singular cactus with a simpler backdrop would have been more appealing to me.  << 6 >>', '2007-08-27 23:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4034398, 572774, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I can''t help picturing the image sans hand!  Perhaps you could have pulled your hand away at the last second before hitting the shutter.  Then again, maybe you already tried that - I know how it is, sometimes you end picking a shot because its the sharpest or best composed... &lt;&lt; 6 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Nice, but I can''t help picturing the image sans hand!  Perhaps you could have pulled your hand away at the last second before hitting the shutter.  Then again, maybe you already tried that - I know how it is, sometimes you end picking a shot because its the sharpest or best composed... << 6 >>', '2007-08-27 23:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
