(4037581, 575292, 65548, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, that''s probably my flash in the back :D.<br/> <br/>I am amazed that you managed to catch her while she was standing still. My photos didn''t turn out so well, because she moved on each and every one of them :). <br/> <br/>I can''t stop thinking, that this photo could have scored better in a different challenge.<br/></td>', 'Nice capture, that''s probably my flash in the back :D. I am amazed that you managed to catch her while she was standing still. My photos didn''t turn out so well, because she moved on each and every one of them :).  I can''t stop thinking, that this photo could have scored better in a different challenge.', '2007-08-29 06:17:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037585, 575244, 58452, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh, that''s where the back lighting comes from.  Funny I''d played with my CP about a month ago and noticed I could completely black out my computer LCD.<br/>Congrats on the image, it''s one of those that fooled many of us into thinking it wasn''t backlit.  Well you didn''t have to worry about my vote affecting you as I didn''t have time to vote on over 20 percent.  Mine were comments only. Congrats on such a high finish.</td>', 'Ahhhh, that''s where the back lighting comes from.  Funny I''d played with my CP about a month ago and noticed I could completely black out my computer LCD.Congrats on the image, it''s one of those that fooled many of us into thinking it wasn''t backlit.  Well you didn''t have to worry about my vote affecting you as I didn''t have time to vote on over 20 percent.  Mine were comments only. Congrats on such a high finish.', '2007-08-29 06:20:26.000000', NULL, 0),
