(4037770, 575197, 66348, '<td valign="top">Wow, Irene you are on fire! This setup is so unique with incredible lighting. Your vision in photography is outstanding. Congrats on another well deserved ribbon and keep up the great work!</td>', 'Wow, Irene you are on fire! This setup is so unique with incredible lighting. Your vision in photography is outstanding. Congrats on another well deserved ribbon and keep up the great work!', '2007-08-29 09:13:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037773, 575510, 68642, '<td valign="top">Yep .. that sucked! LOL  Thanks to all that voted and commented however.<br/>I do appreciate it. It''s all part of the learning curve.<br/> <br/>Puckzzz, good eye!  Those little holes are actually the top of my radio beside my bed.  I snapped this on my night table and the black background is my CD sleeve folder.  The radio was the only thing I could find that was black to raise up the bottle.<br/> <br/>My initial submission was a wooden angel, with metal wire wings with its back facing towards the camera and my backlighting part of it was my flashlight pointed at the feet area.  I felt the flashlight was casting too bright of a white light, so I went with the bottle idea.   <br/> <br/> So as I was editing it was already late in the night and I didn''t want to give up and not submit a photo for the challenge.  Submitted it anyways.<br/> <br/>NEXT !</td>', 'Yep .. that sucked! LOL  Thanks to all that voted and commented however.I do appreciate it. It''s all part of the learning curve. Puckzzz, good eye!  Those little holes are actually the top of my radio beside my bed.  I snapped this on my night table and the black background is my CD sleeve folder.  The radio was the only thing I could find that was black to raise up the bottle. My initial submission was a wooden angel, with metal wire wings with its back facing towards the camera and my backlighting part of it was my flashlight pointed at the feet area.  I felt the flashlight was casting too bright of a white light, so I went with the bottle idea.     So as I was editing it was already late in the night and I didn''t want to give up and not submit a photo for the challenge.  Submitted it anyways. NEXT !', '2007-08-29 09:16:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037777, 575343, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is gorgeous. and it is not a centered composition. there is a big difference between a centered subject and a centered composition.</td>', 'this is gorgeous. and it is not a centered composition. there is a big difference between a centered subject and a centered composition.', '2007-08-29 09:22:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037788, 575396, 50695, '<td valign="top">The fat guy is annoying, but the truth is that he''s the best poet. Starfish knows that, and he hates him for it. This hatred is expressed in bitter lyrics about birds. The short guy is really a novelist. He just doesn''t know it yet. He writes that annoying prose-with-linebreaks stuff. If he ever decides to write about his mother''s car accident, something will click inside him and he will achieve greatness. For now they gaze at their uneaten panini, or out the window, and dream poems they will never write.</td>', 'The fat guy is annoying, but the truth is that he''s the best poet. Starfish knows that, and he hates him for it. This hatred is expressed in bitter lyrics about birds. The short guy is really a novelist. He just doesn''t know it yet. He writes that annoying prose-with-linebreaks stuff. If he ever decides to write about his mother''s car accident, something will click inside him and he will achieve greatness. For now they gaze at their uneaten panini, or out the window, and dream poems they will never write.', '2007-08-29 09:27:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4037789, 573993, 50695, '<td valign="top">It''s sad how many people couldn''t appreciate this photo. Literally sad. Tear-inducing. What other beauty are they missing?</td>', 'It''s sad how many people couldn''t appreciate this photo. Literally sad. Tear-inducing. What other beauty are they missing?', '2007-08-29 09:29:37.000000', NULL, 0),
