(4041273, 573065, 24111, '<td valign="top">I actually entered this knowing it was a ''bad'' image, I was curious what it would score and so many of my ''good'' images score so low that it was just a personal ''test'' . There is actually no lens flare in this image, but I do agree that it is blown out, the expresssion is ''blah'' and just overall a poor quality shot.Thanks 4 the comments.</td>', 'I actually entered this knowing it was a ''bad'' image, I was curious what it would score and so many of my ''good'' images score so low that it was just a personal ''test'' . There is actually no lens flare in this image, but I do agree that it is blown out, the expresssion is ''blah'' and just overall a poor quality shot.Thanks 4 the comments.', '2007-08-30 10:33:51.000000', NULL, 0),
