(4052309, 575316, 33535, '<td valign="top">hey, this is so much underrated imo!<br/>i also really like your second outtake, would love this as a print...<br/>keep up your good work and don''t hesitate to go different ways when interpreting a challenge or theme. you''re on the right track! :)</td>', 'hey, this is so much underrated imo!i also really like your second outtake, would love this as a print...keep up your good work and don''t hesitate to go different ways when interpreting a challenge or theme. you''re on the right track! :)', '2007-09-03 06:25:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4055434, 574989, 78303, '<td valign="top">But, I am over it now.  I understand the rule and the reason for it.  No problems.</td>', 'But, I am over it now.  I understand the rule and the reason for it.  No problems.', '2007-09-04 03:07:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4055451, 575259, 37673, '<td valign="top">Pretty basic snapshot looking photo. You have a chance at the composition but everything else is just there. No pop snap or eye grabbing focul point. It would have been a better pic if you lost all of the detail in the fruit and it went black. That would have added a bit of mystery and another strong color to the mix  This is just My own opinion.<br/> <br/>jtf6agent</td>', 'Pretty basic snapshot looking photo. You have a chance at the composition but everything else is just there. No pop snap or eye grabbing focul point. It would have been a better pic if you lost all of the detail in the fruit and it went black. That would have added a bit of mystery and another strong color to the mix  This is just My own opinion. jtf6agent', '2007-09-04 03:13:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4055482, 575137, 37673, '<td valign="top">Very nice I like the way this was done. The soft pastels in the spoon add color and balance. By leaving the fruit out of focus and the pastel colors from the spoon it has kept the photo moving. It''s almost as if it''s distracting but I like the way it guides the eye around the table. Very well done congradulations. The focus is nice and crisp. It holds your subject up front very well. The lighting is great I would love to know what you shot it under. Did you use available light or did you create this? Excellent work.<br/> <br/>Jtf6agent</td>', 'Very nice I like the way this was done. The soft pastels in the spoon add color and balance. By leaving the fruit out of focus and the pastel colors from the spoon it has kept the photo moving. It''s almost as if it''s distracting but I like the way it guides the eye around the table. Very well done congradulations. The focus is nice and crisp. It holds your subject up front very well. The lighting is great I would love to know what you shot it under. Did you use available light or did you create this? Excellent work. Jtf6agent', '2007-09-04 03:22:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4055506, 575543, 37673, '<td valign="top">Well...3 things here    Noise,    Noise    and more Noise.     It doesn''t help that there is impurities in the water to help magnify the noise. It really creates a distracting picture. You had the right idea don''t get me wrong. Composition puts the bird in the strong middle of the shot. Tough to do unless there is something strong enough to place it dead center. The lighting is too harsh and caused blown highlites. You could have panned back a bit and cought the reflection of the bird and maybe had something. Sorry this shot doesn''t do much for me. Keep trying though I''ve seen your other work and your very good. I was wondering why you didn''t go for BW with this shot??? It would have done much better.<br/> <br/>JTF6Agent</td>', 'Well...3 things here    Noise,    Noise    and more Noise.     It doesn''t help that there is impurities in the water to help magnify the noise. It really creates a distracting picture. You had the right idea don''t get me wrong. Composition puts the bird in the strong middle of the shot. Tough to do unless there is something strong enough to place it dead center. The lighting is too harsh and caused blown highlites. You could have panned back a bit and cought the reflection of the bird and maybe had something. Sorry this shot doesn''t do much for me. Keep trying though I''ve seen your other work and your very good. I was wondering why you didn''t go for BW with this shot??? It would have done much better. JTF6Agent', '2007-09-04 03:28:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4055512, 575401, 37673, '<td valign="top">I have 3 words for you<br/> <br/>WOW GREAT SHOT.  This was well done I like everything about it. Keep up the good work.<br/> <br/>JTF6Agent</td>', 'I have 3 words for you WOW GREAT SHOT.  This was well done I like everything about it. Keep up the good work. JTF6Agent', '2007-09-04 03:30:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4055527, 575475, 37673, '<td valign="top">Very creative, this is a nice shot. I like the composition and the placement of the oragami. There would be a hundred different placements but this one works well. The lighting is great I really like what you did here. The shadows are sharp in some points and soft in others. Your focus works well here also. Not too sharp and not too soft. Very nice shot. keep up the good work.<br/> <br/>JTF6agent</td>', 'Very creative, this is a nice shot. I like the composition and the placement of the oragami. There would be a hundred different placements but this one works well. The lighting is great I really like what you did here. The shadows are sharp in some points and soft in others. Your focus works well here also. Not too sharp and not too soft. Very nice shot. keep up the good work. JTF6agent', '2007-09-04 03:36:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4056812, 573116, 37104, '<td valign="top">Way cool. Love this shot. It''s very artistic, and not as commercial as other DPC shots (not that I don''t like those as well). Wish I could have voted on it.</td>', 'Way cool. Love this shot. It''s very artistic, and not as commercial as other DPC shots (not that I don''t like those as well). Wish I could have voted on it.', '2007-09-04 14:02:10.000000', NULL, 0),
