(4058746, 575165, 72972, '<td valign="top">Why aren''t you first?</td>', 'Why aren''t you first?', '2007-09-05 00:09:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4059303, 574517, 117, '<td valign="top">Whoever came up with the idea I used spot editing is wrong? If you read my comment it tells you what I did and did only. I think in anger I answer back that anyone that was an intermediate in Photoshop would know that levels, curves, and saturation a lot of things can be done because Photoshop is based on mathematics but yes I think more advance would and I was probably wrong. I think and feel that the person or persons that came up with the disqualifications probably needs to go back and look at the situation or get someone else with a little more knowledge of editing. <br/> <br/>Thanks for everyone that voted and your comments.<br/> <br/>Bob Gaither<br/> <br/></td>', 'Whoever came up with the idea I used spot editing is wrong? If you read my comment it tells you what I did and did only. I think in anger I answer back that anyone that was an intermediate in Photoshop would know that levels, curves, and saturation a lot of things can be done because Photoshop is based on mathematics but yes I think more advance would and I was probably wrong. I think and feel that the person or persons that came up with the disqualifications probably needs to go back and look at the situation or get someone else with a little more knowledge of editing.  Thanks for everyone that voted and your comments. Bob Gaither ', '2007-09-05 02:07:49.000000', NULL, 0),
