(4062686, 575316, 80058, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Mephisto:</b></div><hr/><i> hey, this is so much underrated imo!<br/>i also really like your second outtake, would love this as a print...<br/>keep up your good work and don''t hesitate to go different ways when interpreting a challenge or theme. you''re on the right track! :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I will never stop going in a different way! After my first 3 weeks of being mad at this scoring system hauahuahuahuhaua I am happy to carry on with my weird stuff. I am glad you realised that! Means alot! Thank youuuuuuuuuuuu =D <br/> <br/>Then again there was some stunning shots for this challenge but there you go! =)</td>', 'Originally posted by Mephisto: hey, this is so much underrated imo!i also really like your second outtake, would love this as a print...keep up your good work and don''t hesitate to go different ways when interpreting a challenge or theme. you''re on the right track! :)   I will never stop going in a different way! After my first 3 weeks of being mad at this scoring system hauahuahuahuhaua I am happy to carry on with my weird stuff. I am glad you realised that! Means alot! Thank youuuuuuuuuuuu =D  Then again there was some stunning shots for this challenge but there you go! =)', '2007-09-05 19:14:58.000000', NULL, 0),
